{"ID":"20240515131411-y94qcar","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131411-y94qcar","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131411-y94qcar\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140716-fubbxu8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140716-fubbxu8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140716-fubbxu8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:313,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:313\u0026#125;","title":"062","type":"doc","updated":"20240515162722"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515140716-fubbxu8","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 731px;","id":"20240515140716-fubbxu8","updated":"20240515162722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/04/1"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LJ"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"16歲，略矮，中等身材"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/06"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服藥之後，腋下及膕中出汗。且自覺身體痛、肌肉酸痛。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）大便已正常，一日2次。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）服藥之後沒有心悸。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）已無口渴。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"浮數。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡紅。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有出一點汗，但不夠。（無心悸）"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黃四錢 石膏一兩 杏仁四錢 炙甘草三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝三錢 生薑2二片 大棗十枚 厚朴二錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"枳實二錢 大黃二錢 芒硝一錢（分兩包沖服） ×5帖"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以大火6碗煮成2碗，早晚餐前各服一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.病患服藥後諸症狀改善，手掌色雖仍較鮮紅，但熱感減輕，小腿皮膚毛細孔污垢黑點減少，變得較乾淨。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.腋下及膕中因毛細孔較少，故汗出較明顯。至於身體其它部位乃因毛細數量較多，且津液聚於皮肉間尚未能順利發出，故仍較無汗且反而產生身體痛、肌肉酸痛的症狀。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 因此本診處方加重麻黃劑量，加上等量杏仁避免麻黃使用過量發汗傷及肺陰。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}